Check for association with an executor before removing the node in generated component main (#3287) (#3297)

EventsCBGExecutor removes all nodes when the context shuts down, so the
unconditional remove_node() after spin() threw and aborted the process.
Apply the same guard as #3190 did for ComponentManager (see #3186).


(cherry picked from commit a2501cc749d27b6d000f0f2bd8f08342cdb806fc)

